\subsection{Construction}

We construct a prunable net on $24$ layers with $20$ paths, reproducing the
measured table exactly. Each path is a \emph{retention pattern}: the path indexed
by a target set $T_j$ has support $T_j^{c}$, hence survives exactly the prunings
$S\subseteq T_j$, and carries the loss $\ell_j$ recorded for that pattern. All
values are in hundredths of an accuracy point.

